1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dhritarashtra (Sanskrit: धृतराष्ट्र, dhritarāshtra) was King of Hastinapur at the time of the Kurukshetra War, the epic's climactic event. He was born the son of Vichitravirya's first wife Ambika
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dhritarashtra
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Ved Vyasa (Biological Father) Vichitravirya (Dharmic father) 
2 CONT * Ambika (mother) 
2 CONT * Pandu, Vidura (half-brothers)
2 CONT * Spouse Gandhari
2 CONT * Children Duryodhana, Dushasana, Vikarna and 97 other sons and Dushala (daughter) by his wife Gandhari
2 CONT * Yuyutsu by Gandhari's chief maid Sughada
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Dhritarashtra .
2 CONT Dhritarastra
2 CONT
2 CONT The blind king Dhrtarastra listens as the visionary narrator Sanjaya relates the events of the battle between the Kaurava and the Pandava clans Yudhisthira
2 CONT
2 CONT Predecessor	Pandu
2 CONT
2 CONT Successor	Yudhisthira
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse	Gandhari
2 CONT
2 CONT Issue 100 Kaurava sons and a daughter
2 CONT
2 CONT Royal House Kuru Father	Vyasa as foster-son ofVichitravirya
2 CONT
