2 CONC f His spiritual identity, and we also carefully carry that dust on our heads. And still Krishna is not fit to use the royal insignia or even sit on the royal throne? SB 10.68.38: "We Vrishnis enjoy only whatever small parcel of la
2 CONC nd the Kurus allow us? And we are indeed shoes, whereas the Kurus are the head? SB 10.68.39: "Just see how these puffed-up Kurus are intoxicated with their so-called power, like ordinary drunken men! What actual ruler, with the po
