2 CONC  cause the creation, maintenance and annihilation of the cosmos, and of You there is no prior cause. Indeed, O Lord, authorities say that the worlds are mere playthings for you as you perform your pastimes. SB 10.68.46: O unlimite
2 CONC d one of a thousand heads, as your pastime you carry this earthly globe upon one of your heads. At the time of annihilation you withdraw the entire universe within your body and, remaining all alone, lie down to rest. SB 10.68.47:
2 CONC  Your anger is meant for instructing everyone; it is not a manifestation of hatred or envy. O Supreme Lord, You sustain the pure mode of goodness, and you become angry only to maintain and protect this world. SB 10.68.48: We bow d
2 CONC own to You, O Soul of all beings, O wielder of all potencies, O tireless maker of the universe! Offering you obeisance’s, we take shelter of you. SB 10.68.49: Sukadeva Gosvami said: Thus propitiated by the Kurus, whose city was tr
